@startuml
title Reuse an existing Brave connection
actor Learner
participant Settings
participant Runtime
database "Local endpoint metadata" as Metadata
participant "Loopback proxy" as Proxy
participant Brave
Learner -> Settings: Enable website protection with consent
Settings -> Runtime: configure(BRAVE)
Runtime -> Metadata: Read saved port and PAC identifier
Runtime -> Proxy: Bind saved port with fresh verification challenge
alt Saved port unavailable or metadata invalid
  Runtime --> Settings: Unavailable; do not change endpoint
else Saved connection and Brave already open
  Runtime -> Brave: Open verification page once (no forced exit)
  alt Browser still uses this proxy
    Brave -> Proxy: Fresh verification request
    Proxy --> Runtime: Routing observed
    Runtime --> Settings: Connected
  else Browser bypasses proxy
    Runtime --> Settings: Connection unverified; offer check or explicit setup
  end
else First setup or browser closed
  Runtime --> Settings: Explicit setup available; no automatic browser launch
end
Learner -> Runtime: Start / pause / stop session
Runtime -> Proxy: Reevaluate rules; keep same connection
Learner -> Settings: Disable website protection
Settings -> Runtime: Revoke consent
Runtime -> Proxy: Close listener and active connections
note over Metadata: Keep only reusable endpoint metadata, never proof or consent
@enduml
